- labeled intervention data is in ./mnist_images_concat.csv (1.4G)
	- see below for label dictionary
- original MNIST data is in ./MNIST
- transformed versions are in ./ 
	- mnist_images_<label>.csv
- python script to visualize and compare datasets in mnist_compare_digits_csv.py
- python script to generate new transformed samples is in mnist_apply_transform.py


